                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c47f0dad-daf7-4475-b10c-56c3a487fea3",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed86ad51-8cc3-3fd1-a720-e7a26344a10a",
                        "source_sense_id": "5305fabf-97b8-3675-8a5f-c1dcfda503d5",
                        "source_sense_description": "Zauberer",
                        "target_lang_word": "magus",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "magus",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f54a7583-9e37-354f-9a0a-d88a9232a9e4",
                                        "entry_id": "b30be77f-9cd5-30a1-8bbc-63630adc81ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A magician; (derogatory) a conjurer or sorcerer, especially one who is a charlatan or trickster."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "419f6932-63e4-4e17-8d0e-f9859645e813",
                                                "sense_id": "f54a7583-9e37-354f-9a0a-d88a9232a9e4",
                                                "text": "In the middle of the fifth century, Empedocles testified to the vitality of these maguses, who were capable of commanding the winds and of bringing the dead back from Hades and who presented themselves, not as mortals, but as gods."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3f38907-8ead-4849-9d28-e9bb227dc549",
                                                "sense_id": "f54a7583-9e37-354f-9a0a-d88a9232a9e4",
                                                "text": "It’s from our venerable maguses Gominik Halvor and his son. They’ve cast the runes for our enterprise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b198b12-5ec9-345e-85a0-56c954e7ca94",
                                        "entry_id": "b30be77f-9cd5-30a1-8bbc-63630adc81ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A Zoroastrian priest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a327cda-7b06-434c-97fd-90a032cc8d21",
                                                "sense_id": "0b198b12-5ec9-345e-85a0-56c954e7ca94",
                                                "text": "Court astrologers, who were drawn from the race of the Magi, were among those that formed the royal court [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3de8e76-e063-4a77-8935-d12dad7cd4b3",
                                                "sense_id": "0b198b12-5ec9-345e-85a0-56c954e7ca94",
                                                "text": "Mocenigo / [satisfied at last] / Good! Now, tell me, Prior, / What is Rome’s greatest fear? What gives the Pope / More night-mares than bad sausage? / Prior Gabrielli / Heresy! / The rendering of the seamless robe of truth. / This rabble of mountebanks and maguses / Who shout reform, defile the Eucharist, / Flout all authority, elect false bishops, / Deny the Trinity and saving grace, / Abolish marriage, set their private minds / Against the long tradition of the Faith / And Peter’s dictates and the Holy Writ . . ."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e74b5ef6-c314-4d9f-8312-840efcd0102e",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed86ad51-8cc3-3fd1-a720-e7a26344a10a",
                        "source_sense_id": "5305fabf-97b8-3675-8a5f-c1dcfda503d5",
                        "source_sense_description": "Zauberer",
                        "target_lang_word": "wizard",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wizard",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5a244ed-983f-3aed-8029-fcd8192143f3",
                                        "entry_id": "19d0f991-6072-34c3-bdcd-d0f490198ac1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone, usually male, who uses (or has skill with) magic, mystic items, and magical and mystical practices."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02cc2a53-a6f5-4eaf-829c-95a21399bb85",
                                                "sense_id": "d5a244ed-983f-3aed-8029-fcd8192143f3",
                                                "text": "The wizard conjured up a large fireball."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "906c257a-35ed-4f4a-baef-d3347a3976ca",
                                                "sense_id": "d5a244ed-983f-3aed-8029-fcd8192143f3",
                                                "text": "The wily wizard must be caught."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0281bde3-e8ba-4476-98d2-d0a743cf7196",
                                                "sense_id": "d5a244ed-983f-3aed-8029-fcd8192143f3",
                                                "text": "He found himself watching a couple of wizards doing what he at first mistook for the beginning of a dance, and then for a session of tai chi. But suddenly he realized they were signing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c797160a-13e2-4e47-9dec-99c252b0d42c",
                                                "sense_id": "d5a244ed-983f-3aed-8029-fcd8192143f3",
                                                "text": "But that's not what will make her a powerful wizard – more powerful than me, more powerful than Leesha, even more powerful than you."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2489e501-273e-3c2f-b6e0-b8c6a15b367f",
                                        "entry_id": "19d0f991-6072-34c3-bdcd-d0f490198ac1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who is especially skilled or unusually talented in a particular field."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0e1f23c-8d5f-492c-9f3e-c491f05435dc",
                                                "sense_id": "2489e501-273e-3c2f-b6e0-b8c6a15b367f",
                                                "text": "He was a financial wizard, capable of predicting the movements of the stock markets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b43d913-2956-38ff-a864-55a9710140df",
                                        "entry_id": "19d0f991-6072-34c3-bdcd-d0f490198ac1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A computer program or script used to simplify complex operations, often for an inexperienced user."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88077513-13f9-46f4-8da0-712e0451c202",
                                                "sense_id": "4b43d913-2956-38ff-a864-55a9710140df",
                                                "text": "Use the \"Add Network Connection\" wizard to connect to a network in a series of simple steps."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f739f792-d52a-4fa0-8a4b-ede1fcafe27f",
                                                "sense_id": "4b43d913-2956-38ff-a864-55a9710140df",
                                                "text": "Figure 10-10 shows a typical wizard. The user enters data in New Employee on each tab and then moves on to the next one. This wizard asks […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "07ee6a62-f0ea-3134-a3c9-5be00185d449",
                                        "entry_id": "19d0f991-6072-34c3-bdcd-d0f490198ac1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of the administrators of a multi-user dungeon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f3bb1b6-2ef8-413c-b332-09a0a333c2da",
                                                "sense_id": "07ee6a62-f0ea-3134-a3c9-5be00185d449",
                                                "text": "Wizards, in general, have a very different experience of mudding than other players. Because of their palpable and extensive extra powers over other players, and because of their special role in MUD society, they are frequently treated differently[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5da87e17-d937-4030-9f89-34c3fd012784",
                                                "sense_id": "07ee6a62-f0ea-3134-a3c9-5be00185d449",
                                                "text": "It is certainly easy to believe the stories I hear of MUD wizards who demand deference and severely punish those who transgress […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a0c5b99-9ec4-3d56-89e4-4b2c3a1bad09",
                                        "entry_id": "19d0f991-6072-34c3-bdcd-d0f490198ac1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wise man; a sage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88201820-9e84-4534-a5e4-2d84eef5def1",
                                                "sense_id": "0a0c5b99-9ec4-3d56-89e4-4b2c3a1bad09",
                                                "text": "See how from far upon the eastern road / The star-led wizards [Magi] haste with odours sweet!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e4908a4-7c3e-3a17-bb9f-385076925c26",
                                        "entry_id": "19d0f991-6072-34c3-bdcd-d0f490198ac1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A virgin over the age of 30 who does not socialize and thus cannot find a sexual partner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "humorous",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6fe7536-c76c-432e-ac68-9f1fc6720a60",
                                                "sense_id": "0e4908a4-7c3e-3a17-bb9f-385076925c26",
                                                "text": "“I see this image of the basement-dwelling wizard who rejects societal conventions to such an extreme degree as one of the tragic heroes of our times.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df81ee5f-b204-4f93-8e9e-fa6a7d3c8762",
                                                "sense_id": "0e4908a4-7c3e-3a17-bb9f-385076925c26",
                                                "text": "The incels’ folk hero is the 30-year-old virgin wizard – if you can make it to 30 without having sex, you will be endowed with magical powers. And the threads are so pathetic that it is hard to feel anything but ambient pity (on the site Wiz Chan – subtitle “disregard females, acquire magic” – one thread titled How do I live in my sedan? is like a short story)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e51d1df-ca45-4144-adde-d938d70acb8f",
                                                "sense_id": "0e4908a4-7c3e-3a17-bb9f-385076925c26",
                                                "text": "Incels are mostly losers who don’t get laid — involuntarily celibate. Basically it’s a giant pity party that started on the 4chan board R9K. R9K is a board on 4chan where inceldom started. They have their own terms and stuff like that. For example if you’re over 30 and still a virgin they call you a \"Wizard.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "wizard",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "094e2932-a3a5-3d15-8401-6fd8e7dee0d8",
                                        "entry_id": "e1ac674e-ce2f-3617-b85a-b3f2d1b2abc4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fine, superb (originally RAF slang)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British",
                                            "dated",
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a77b552-3b89-430e-8bfd-159ce29d4f59",
                                                "sense_id": "094e2932-a3a5-3d15-8401-6fd8e7dee0d8",
                                                "text": "\"We had a wizard show,\" the young leader of an Australian squadron said, trying to keep the excitement out of his voice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "037132f5-c502-46f6-9f06-2b5dbef577e3",
                                                "sense_id": "094e2932-a3a5-3d15-8401-6fd8e7dee0d8",
                                                "text": "But he was a wizard flyer, that boy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "wizard",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6dafa8aa-4314-3272-bf0d-1a0fc764c67d",
